WEBVTT

1
00:00:03,630 --> 00:00:05,630
Don’t pick up so many gold bars yet

2
00:00:05,630 --> 00:00:10,130
What did life taste like before it was better than gold?

3
00:00:11,550 --> 00:00:13,110
Whose family is boiling sugar?

4
00:00:13,110 --> 00:00:24,320
This powdery sword blood is the most popular

5
00:00:24,320 --> 00:00:26,600
None of you will survive today

6
00:00:26,600 --> 00:00:27,760
want my life

7
00:00:28,380 --> 00:00:32,870
Your little poison is not enough to make us brothers.

8
00:00:32,870 --> 00:00:34,590
He bit his tongue and didn't curl it up

9
00:00:35,310 --> 00:00:37,020
Don't open it again

10
00:00:37,020 --> 00:00:39,500
People should die if other powder enters the lungs

11
00:00:39,500 --> 00:00:40,540
Venom has been reinvented

12
00:00:40,780 --> 00:00:41,780
You are hard now

13
00:00:41,780 --> 00:00:42,940
He can't take a breath

14
00:00:42,940 --> 00:00:43,900
Die on the spot
